              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 3:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo, mulao wamwami kuti kawiimikidwe akutuminwa maleya mubwami bwakwe boonse (nkaambo mbupati), boonse bakaintu bayoolemeka baalumi babo, bapati abaniini.",
          "type": "text",
